            "slug": "lexco-lzl-zero-lift-tables",
            "title": "Lexco LZL Zero Lift Tables",
            "excerpt": "Hydraulic zero lift tables rated 2,000 or 4,000 lb, with 30 or 40 in. of travel on 50 in. wide platforms.",
            "content": "<p>Lexco LZL Zero Lift Tables are hydraulic lift tables for loading at floor level.</p>\n<p>They are rated 2,000 or 4,000 lb, with 30 or 40 in. of travel on 50 x 48 or 50 x 60 in. platforms. Options include a covered foot switch, a warning beeper and flashing light, increased horsepower, hand rails, a transition bridge, three-phase power and accordion skirting.</p>",
            "line_code": "LZL",
            "key_features": [
                "2,000 or 4,000 lb capacities",
                "30 or 40 in. of travel",
                "50 in. wide platforms",
                "Transition bridge option"
            ],
