        {
            "slug": "lexco-ht-fr-rotating-hydraulic-lift-tables",
            "title": "Lexco HT-FR Foot Operated Hydraulic Lift Tables",
            "excerpt": "Light-duty mobile foot pump post lift tables with a 360-degree rotating top, rated 200 to 500 lb.",
            "content": "<p>Lexco HT-FR tables are small mobile hydraulic lift tables raised with a foot pump. The top rotates 360 degrees, and the top and base are 3/16 in. steel.</p>\n<p>Models are rated 200 to 500 lb, with 12 to 18 in. of lift and four 2 in. swivel rubber casters. They carry a 1-year warranty and are made in the USA.</p>",
            "line_code": "HT-FR",
            "key_features": [
