        {
            "slug": "lexco-foot-operated-and-electric-hydraulic-lift-tables",
            "title": "Lexco Foot Operated and Electric Hydraulic Lift Tables",
            "excerpt": "Mobile 2,000 lb hydraulic post lift tables with foot pump or AC/DC power, on 20 x 30 to 30 x 48 in. tops.",
            "content": "<p>These Lexco mobile lift tables have precision telescoping guide tubes and 1/4 in. reinforced steel tops and bases, and are raised by foot pump with AC and DC power options.</p>\n<p>All models are rated 2,000 lb, with 12 to 18 in. of lift and tops of 20 x 30, 30 x 30 or 30 x 48 in. Smaller models have two rigid and two swivel 5 in. steel wheels and a floor lock, and 30 x 48 in. models four swivel wheels and two floor locks.</p>",
            "line_code": "HT-2F / HT-24",
            "key_features": [
                "2,000 lb capacity",
