        {
            "slug": "lexco-portable-hydraulic-lift-tables",
            "title": "Lexco Portable Hydraulic Lift Tables",
            "excerpt": "Heavy-duty portable hydraulic post lift tables for dies and tooling, rated 3,000 to 6,000 lb, foot operated or powered.",
            "content": "<p>Lexco's heavy-duty portable lift tables carry dies and heavy tooling on 1/4 in. steel tops and bases, guided by precision telescoping guide tubes.</p>\n<p>Models are rated 3,000, 4,000, 5,000 or 6,000 lb, foot operated or with AC or DC power. They roll on two rigid and two swivel steel wheel casters with floor locks, and are made in the USA.</p>",
            "line_code": "HT-30",
