        {
            "slug": "lexco-stn-long-deck-lift-tables",
            "title": "Lexco STN Long Deck Lift Tables",
            "excerpt": "Foot-operated hydraulic post lift tables with long 10 gauge steel decks, rated 2,000 to 5,000 lb, with 30 to 48 in. of lift.",
            "content": "<p>Lexco STN Long Deck Lift Tables are foot-operated hydraulic tables with long 10 gauge steel tops, on precision telescoping guide tubes.</p>\n<p>Models are rated 2,000, 3,000 or 5,000 lb, with a standard lift range of 30 to 48 in. and other ranges available. They roll on four 5 in. swivel steel wheels, or optional polyurethane wheels, with two floor locks. AC and DC powered versions are available.</p>",
