        {
            "slug": "lexco-dh-die-handlers",
            "title": "Lexco DH Die Handlers",
            "excerpt": "Mobile hydraulic die carts that transport, separate and present dies, rated 2,000 to 4,000 lb.",
            "content": "<p>The Lexco DH series hydraulic die handler is a mobile die cart for transporting, separating and presenting dies for service and maintenance. Adjustable steel clamps grip the upper die set for separation, and rigid die hangers with indexing clamps are standard.</p>\n<p>Die handlers are rated 2,000 to 4,000 lb and rotate 360 degrees in 45-degree increments. Precision telescoping guide tubes and a floor lock are standard.</p>",
            "line_code": "DH",
            "key_features": [
                "2,000 to 4,000 lb capacities",
